# Input files for the "Generate Secrets.swift" build phase. Declaring the
# out-of-repo secret lets Xcode's build system skip the phase when nothing
# changed. The path mirrors .a8c-secrets/repo-id; if that value is re-cased the
# only cost is the phase re-running, since the script derives the real path.
${SRCROOT}/Demo/Secrets.tpl
${HOME}/.a8c-secrets/Gravatar-SDK-iOS@github.com@Automattic/Secrets.swift
